<title>JAPAN: Kanto Bank shares fall on lower dividend forecast.</title>
<headline>Kanto Bank shares fall on lower dividend forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Kanto Bank Ltd declined on Tuesday morning, depressed by the bank's announcement late on Monday that it lowered its forecast for its dividend in 1996/97 to 25 yen from the previous forecast of 50 yen, traders said.</p>
<p>At 0035 GMT, the regional bank's shares were down 40 yen at 1,600. Trading volume was 8,300 shares.</p>
</text>
